<p>I upvoted, but I have to note one issue about the science:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Biweekly, SCP-2550 is to be administered specially designed Selective Serotonin Reuptake Inhibitors (SSRIs) designed to alter the brain chemistry of the Phoebastria albatrus to increase serotonin production.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>SSRI medications specifically block the destruction of serotonin, not increase the production-it's in the name. L-tryptophan increases production, and drugs that increase the release of serotonin include dextromethorphan, methadone, and ecstasy. I recommend changing the last word to &quot;levels&quot; instead of &quot;production&quot;. I know it is picayune, but it is better science.</p>

